 To find the most expensive ticket for a New York Knicks game on April 9, we will first search for the URL displaying tickets for that specific date using web_search. After obtaining the URL, we will use the web_browser tool to navigate to that page and find the ticket listing. Then we will utilize the beautifulsoup_scraper tool to extract structured HTML content from the page. Finally, we will use python_repl to search for the most expensive ticket price.

