  "name": "web_browser",
  "arguments": {
    "query": "{game_url}"
  }
}
```
3. Utilize the beautifulsoup_scraper tool to extract structured HTML content from the page.
```json
{
  "name": "beautifulsoup_scraper",
  "arguments": {
    "query": "{game_url}"
  }
}
```
4. Use python_repl to search for the most expensive ticket price.
